OL,3,GNEWSAMysterious Mercury is about to get
OL,4,Aa visitor - after spacecraft's
OL,5,Aeight-year epic voyage
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter an eight-year journey travelling
OL,8,Falmost six billion miles (10bn km), a
OL,9,Fspacecraft called BepiColombo is about
OL,10,Fto reach its final destination and get
OL,11,Finto orbit around Mercury.
OL,13,FIt will be entering an extremely
OL,14,Fhostile environment: Mercury is the
OL,15,Fclosest planet to the Sun and
OL,16,Ftemperatures can reach a fierce 430C
OL,17,Fand then plunge to -180C, and it is
OL,18,Fconstantly blasted with intense solar
OL,19,Fradiation.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
