OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMysterious Mercury is about to get
OL,4,Aa visitor - after spacecraft's
OL,5,Aeight-year epic voyage
OL,6,
OL,7,FUntil now, the planet has been little
OL,8,Fexplored but the hope is this mission
OL,9,Fwill solve some of Mercury's major
OL,10,Fmysteries.
OL,12,FThese include uncovering why there is
OL,13,Fice in its craters despite its
OL,14,Fproximity to the Sun, and understanding
OL,15,Fthe mysterious hollows that are dotted
OL,16,Fall over its surface.
